            <ArticleTitle>Advances in the approach to acute coronary syndromes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-4, 67-70, 73-4 passim</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute coronary syndromes is a new term that encompasses the many permutations of acute ischemic heart disease. Management guidelines can help steer clinicians through diagnosis and facilitate rational selection of therapy from the myriad of available treatments.</AbstractText>
